et you know that we can be of assistance when you prepare stories on the upcoming negotiations. We can provide you with a broad range of information on Chile such as media kits and interview opportunities with Chilean officials.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"bullets-intro\">\n        It is important to keep in mind why the Nafta nations selected Chile as their first Latin American partner:\n      </p>\n\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>Chile’s economy has undergone dramatic reform and is one of the most open and advanced in Latin America;</li>\n        <li>Chile can serve as a key building block in expanding economic reforms and more open trade throughout the hemisphere;</li>\n        <li>Chile is a proven investment partner for the U.S.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"closing\">\n        Please feel free to contact me if I can be of any assistance. My phone number is 202-371-0200.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sincerely\">Sincerely,</div>\n      <div class=\"signature\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Signature]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"signature-name\">Jeffrey M. Surrell</div>\n\n      <div class=\"stamp\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Stamp: illegible]</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"footer-row\">\n        Atlanta&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Chicago&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Dallas&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Houston&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Los Angeles&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Louisville&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; New York&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Sacramento&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; San Francisco&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Silicon Valley&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Washington\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-row\">\n        Argentina&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Beijing&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Brussels&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Dublin&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Frankfurt&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Guangzhou&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hong Kong&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Kuala Lumpur&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; London&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Madrid&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Melbourne\n      </div>\n      <div class